\]

(b) The integral of $3e^x + 2\sqrt{x}$ is $\int (3e^x + 2\sqrt{x}) \, dx = 3e^x + 2 \cdot \frac{1}{3} x^{3/2} + C = 3e^x + \frac{2}{3} x^{3/2} + C$.  
