   \lambda_d = \frac{2\pi}{k_F} = \frac{2\pi}{k_0 (1 - (n_{\text{eff}} - n_f))} = \frac{2\pi}{6.63 \times 10^7 \, \text{rad/s} \times (1 - 0.3)} = \frac{2\pi}{6.63 \times 10^7 \times 0.7} = \frac{2\pi}{4.65 \times 10^7 \, \text{rad/s}} \approx 2.7 \times 10^{-7} \, \text{m} = 200 \, \mu m
